      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "With items in the cart the rows, discounts and gift note are the real cart. The Line blocks are the preview (theme editor with an empty cart). Shipping is an estimate from the threshold and fee below, in your shop currency; the real rate is set at checkout."
    },
